---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Lemonski Tours | Guided ATV Tours in Berlin, NH & the North Country"
  description="Guided ATV & buggy tours across New Hampshire's North Country and the Ride the Wilds trails — Berlin, Gorham, Milan & beyond. Bring your own buggy or rent locally, then follow a local guide to the best views and stories."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg" role="img" aria-label="ATV riders overlooking New Hampshire's North Country mountains"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow light">Guided ATV tours · Berlin, NH &amp; the Ride the Wilds trails</p>
      <h1>Don't just ride.<br><em>Know the trail.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">Bring your own buggy or rent one locally — either way, add a Lemonski tour and follow a local guide across the North Country's Ride the Wilds trails, from Berlin and Gorham to the views and stories you'd miss on your own.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/book">Add a guided tour <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="text-link light-link" href="/guide">Meet your guide <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-proof" aria-label="Tour highlights">
      <div><strong>Local</strong><span>trail knowledge</span></div>
      <div><strong>Your buggy</strong><span>own it or rent locally</span></div>
      <div><strong>Included</strong><span>photos along the way</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro section" id="experience">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">The North Country, up close</p>
      <h2>A ride you'll still be talking about next year.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <p>Already own a buggy? Bring it. Visiting and need a machine? Rent one from a local ATV shop. Either way, add a Lemonski guided tour and make it a real North Country adventure.</p>
      <p>You stay behind the wheel while your local guide leads the way. Every tour is shaped around your crew, experience, and the kind of day you want.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="benefits section">
    <article class="benefit-card">
      <span class="card-number">01</span>
      <div class="line-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</div>
      <h3>Ride the good stuff</h3>
      <p>Drive your rented buggy and follow a local to scenic trails, hidden lookouts, and worthwhile stops.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="benefit-card featured">
      <span class="card-number">02</span>
      <div class="line-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</div>
      <h3>Stay in the moment</h3>
      <p>Your guide captures photos along the way, so your whole group makes it into the memory.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="benefit-card">
      <span class="card-number">03</span>
      <div class="line-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</div>
      <h3>Add on the adventure</h3>
      <p>Own a buggy or renting locally — just add a personal guide so your time on the trails really counts.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="guide section" id="guide">
    <div class="guide-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/logo-concepts/recommended-badge.svg" alt="" />
      <span class="stamp">LOCAL<br>GUIDED<br>ADVENTURES</span>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Meet your guide</p>
      <h2>This isn't a bus tour. It's personal.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Lemonski Tours is a guided experience you can add to any ride — whether you're renting locally or bringing your own machine.</p>
      <p>You drive while an easygoing local guide leads you to the good stuff, shares the stories behind the trail, and shapes the day around your group.</p>
      <blockquote>
        “My favorite part is showing someone a place they never would have found on their own.”
        <cite>— James Leeman, your local guide</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <a class="text-link" href="/guide">More about your guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="plan section">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your adventure starts here</p>
      <h2>Three easy steps to a better day outside.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <span>1</span>
        <h3>Get your buggy</h3>
        <p>Bring your own side-by-side or ATV, or reserve one with a local North Country rental partner.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>2</span>
        <h3>Add your tour</h3>
        <p>Tell us your date, group size, experience, and what kind of ride sounds best.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>3</span>
        <h3>Drive and explore</h3>
        <p>Meet your guide, get behind the wheel, and let's get riding.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="audience">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow light">Made for real people</p>
      <h2>You don't need to be an expert. You just need to want an adventure.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="audience-list">
      <span>Families</span>
      <span>Couples</span>
      <span>First-timers</span>
      <span>Weekend adventurers</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reviews section" id="reviews">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="eyebrow">Riders &amp; reviews</p>
      <h2>Ride with us, then tell folks how it went.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="reviews-intro">Lemonski Tours is a young, local operation — every honest review helps the next rider find us. Took a tour already? It takes 30 seconds to leave a review on Google, and it means the world.</p>
    <div class="reviews-cta">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="https://g.page/r/CeTLKK_-FrhQEAE/review" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Leave a review on Google <span aria-hidden="true">★</span></a>
    </div>

    <!-- REVIEW SHOWCASE — hidden until real reviews exist. Fill each card with a
         genuine quote + name, then remove the `hidden` attribute below. -->
    <div class="review-grid" hidden>
      <figure class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>Real review quote goes here.</blockquote>
        <figcaption>— First name L., Town</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>Real review quote goes here.</blockquote>
        <figcaption>— First name L., Town</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>Real review quote goes here.</blockquote>
        <figcaption>— First name L., Town</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="booking" id="book">
    <div class="booking-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow light">Let's plan your ride</p>
      <h2>Pick a time and let's ride.</h2>
      <p>We run two tours every Saturday and Sunday — a morning tour at <strong>9 am</strong> and an afternoon tour at <strong>2 pm</strong>. Tours starting at <strong>$200</strong>.</p>
      <div class="page-cta">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/book">Book your tour <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
